STEP BY STEP GUIDE ON HOW TO OPEN  ANACONDA PROMPT
STEP 1: Go to the down part of your labtop and click on the WINDOW/START BUTTON
Type ANACONDA Prompt (it will pop up)
Click ANACONDA3  to open it (BLACK SCREEN will appear)

STEP 2
Go to JUPYTER LAB (In the black screen, type jupyter Lab and click on ENTER. Wait for 10seconds)
Search for the folder you need ,launch it (unzip by double clicking it)
